sequenceDiagram
    participant Cliente as Cliente
    participant API as API
    participant Domain as Domain Order
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Kitchen as Kitchen Context

    Cliente->>API: POST /order<br/>{fulfillment: TABLE, table_number: 5}<br/>X-Tenant-ID: abc
    API->>Domain: CreateOrderCommand
    Domain->>PG: OrderForm.__init__()<br/>set_fulfillment()<br/>INSERT order
    PG-->>Domain: OK
    Domain-->>API: OrderForm
    API-->>Cliente: 201 + OrderResponse

    Cliente->>API: POST /order/1/items<br/>{item: X-Burger, price: 29.90}
    API->>Domain: AddOrderItemCommand
    Domain->>PG: find_by_id(1, "abc")
    PG-->>Domain: OrderForm
    Domain->>PG: OrderFormItem.create<br/>order.add_item()<br/>INSERT item
    PG-->>Domain: OK
    Domain-->>API: OrderForm
    API-->>Cliente: 201 + ItemResponse

    Note over API,Kitchen: BackgroundTask: _notify_kitchen()
    API->>Kitchen: KitchenService.receive_item()
    Kitchen->>Kitchen: Kitchen PG + Kitchen Mongo + WebSocket KDS